
# main-overview

## Development Guidelines

- Only modify code directly relevant to the specific request. Avoid changing unrelated functionality.
- Never replace code with placeholders like `# ... rest of the processing ...`. Always include complete code.
- Break problems into smaller steps. Think through each step separately before implementing.
- Always provide a complete PLAN with REASONING based on evidence from code and logs before making changes.
- Explain your OBSERVATIONS clearly, then provide REASONING to identify the exact issue. Add console logs when needed to gather more information.


Primary Business Systems:

1. Call Center Transfer Management (85/100)
- County-specific routing system with language preference handling
- Time-zone aware agent scheduling
- Warm transfer protocol with hold music integration
- DTMF-controlled transfer acceptance system
- Fuzzy agent name matching with alias support

Key Path: app/telnyx_tools.py

2. Bail Status Processing System (75/100)
- Bond format normalization engine
- Eligibility determination framework
- Special case handling for PR bonds
- Multi-collection lookup system
- Human review triggering logic

Key Path: app/telnyx_tools.py

3. Geographic Compliance System (70/100)
- Multi-provider location verification
- VPN/proxy detection
- Provider fallback chain implementation
- Location data normalization
- ASN organization classification

Key Path: app/geo.py

Component Integration:
- Call center transfers integrate with bail status processing for agent routing
- Geographic compliance validates all transfer and bail operations
- Bond status determines transfer eligibility and routing priorities

The system implements specialized workflows for bail bond management, integrating call center operations with location-based compliance monitoring and bond status verification.

